The file beats_lstm_2016.npz in this directory contains the trained weights of
the online beat-tracking LSTM ensemble distributed with madmom
(https://github.com/CPJKU/madmom, models/beats/2016/beats_lstm_[1-8].pkl),
converted to a single NumPy archive together with the logarithmic filterbank
matrix used as the network input. No weights were modified.

